# OCDP allowlist: track only the launcher plus the root files below.
# Everything else at root (downloaded app, user data, scratch) is ignored.
/*
!/launcher/
!/AGENTS.md
!/README.md
!/README.pt-BR.md
!/LICENSE
!/.gitignore

# Logs are never committed (including launcher\ocdp.log)
*.log
*.log.old

# Launcher state (previous portable root; rewritten on every run)
launcher/root.marker

# Local safety backup of the previous launcher (git history has it anyway)
launcher/*.bak

# Personal agent notes (never committed; the launcher never touches them)
**/AGENTS.user.md

# OS/Explorer noise
**/desktop.ini
**/Thumbs.db
